  "[action] The eldest son returns from a trip with Pear Blossom.",
  "[action] (to the eldest son) Wang Lung stands and stares at his son.",
  "the eldest son (to Wang Lung): \"It is a good thing and I am proud of it,\"",
  "[action] The eldest son stands with his back to his father.",
  "[silence] (to the eldest son) Wang Lung says nothing.",
  "[action] (to the eldest son) Wang Lung looks at his son with amazement.",
  "[action] The eldest son eats and looks at his father with indifference.",
  "[says] The eldest son discusses a new boat with his father.",
  "the eldest son (to Wang Lung): \"It is a great boat and it will be the finest in the land,\"",
  "Wang Lung (to the eldest son): \"What is your need of a boat, my son?\"",
  "Wang Lung (to the eldest son): \"I will not have my son idle and I will not have my son poor,\"",
  "the eldest son (to Wang Lung): \"I will buy it and I will make a good thing of it and my wife will be proud of me and my children will be proud of their father,\"",
